"url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Chromium_Rhuell","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Chromium_Rhuell#:~:text=managed%20to%20put%20the%20sleep%2Dspell%20back%20on%20Palladia","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Chromium Rhuell\", section \"Ham, the Tickery Man\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]}],"status":{"text":"Palladia-Mors was last shown put back under a sleep spell at Mors Ridge, though a later story calls her a surviving ill-tempered elder dragon.","cites":["palladia-mors-e4","p:stories/chronicle-bolas-perspectives-2018-08-08"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Palladia-Mors#:~:text=Ham%20was%20the%20benevolent%20Elder%20Dragon%20Chromium%20Rhuell","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-perspectives-2018-08-08"],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Palladia-Mors","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Palladia-Mors","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Palladia-Mors#:~:text=Ham%20was%20the%20benevolent%20Elder%20Dragon%20Chromium%20Rhuell","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Palladia-Mors\", section \"Battle at Mors Ridge\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: Perspectives","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-08-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-perspectives-2018-08-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-perspectives-2018-08-08","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: Perspectives\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Aug 2018."}]}},"timeline":[{"id":"chromium-rhuell-e3","era":{"date":"1994-06-01","era":"leg","label":"Legends"},"summary":"Vaevictis wakes Palladia, who rampages at Mors Ridge; Chromium and Ad'Amra put her back to sleep.","participants":["chromium-rhuell","palladia-mors","vaevictis-asmadi","ad-amra"],"location":"mors-ridge","importance":"major","page":"wiki/chromium-rhuell","order":1391,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":4,"quote":"managed to put the sleep-spell back on Palladia","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Chromium_Rhuell#:~:text=managed%20to%20put%20the%20sleep%2Dspell%20back%20on%20Palladia","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Chromium Rhuell","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Chromium_Rhuell","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Chromium_Rhuell#:~:text=managed%20to%20put%20the%20sleep%2Dspell%20back%20on%20Palladia","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Chromium Rhuell\", section \"Ham, the Tickery Man\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"elder-dragon-war-e2","era":{"date":"1994-06-01","era":"leg","label":"Legends"},"summary":"Bolas manipulates the dragon clans against each other.","participants":["nicol-bolas","palladia-mors"],"location":"dominaria","importance":"major","page":"wiki/elder-dragon-war","order":1586,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"Manipulating the many dragon clans, he turned them against each other.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Elder_Dragon_War#:~:text=Manipulating%20the%20many%20dragon,them%20against%20each%20other.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Elder Dragon War","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Elder_Dragon_War","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Elder_Dragon_War#:~:text=Manipulating%20the%20many%20dragon,them%20against%20each%20other.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Elder Dragon War\", section \"The manipulations of Bolas\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-twins-2018-06-13-e9","era":null,"summary":"In the vision, a blind great shadow beats its wings and drops e