olas-blood-and-fire-2018-07-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-blood-and-fire-2018-07-18#:~:text=We%20are%20the%20descendants,raid%20where%20we%20wish%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: Blood and Fire\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Jul 2018."}},{"id":"chronicle-bolas-blood-and-fire-2018-07-18-e18","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: Nicol spreads lies among the descendants of Vaevictis's brothers and Palladia-Mors, igniting clan wars among the dragons.","participants":["nicol-bolas","palladia-mors"],"location":"the-birth-mountain","importance":"major","page":"stories/chronicle-bolas-blood-and-fire-2018-07-18","order":661,"story_date":"2018-07-18","storyline":"Chronicle of Bolas","source":"wizards","paragraph":172,"quote":"The ease with which the gullible could be turned to his purpose was surprisingly pleasurable.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-blood-and-fire-2018-07-18#:~:text=The%20ease%20with%20which,purpose%20was%20surprisingly%20pleasurable.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Chronicle of Bolas: Blood and Fire","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kate Elliott"],"date":"2018-07-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-blood-and-fire-2018-07-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/chronicle-bolas-blood-and-fire-2018-07-18#:~:text=The%20ease%20with%20which,purpose%20was%20surprisingly%20pleasurable.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Chronicle of Bolas: Blood and Fire\" by Kate Elliott. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Jul 2018."}},{"id":"palladia-mors-e0","era":null,"summary":"Palladia-Mors, impressionable, joins the Elder Dragon War as instigated by Nicol Bolas.","participants":["palladia-mors","nicol-bolas","elder-dragon-war"],"location":null,"importance":"minor","page":"wiki/palladia-mors","order":2530,"story_date":